=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pandas-dev/pandas/labels/Algos","name":"Algos","color":"eb6420","default":false,"description":"Non-arithmetic algos: value_counts, factorize, sorting, isin, clip, shift, diff"},{"id":5879800042,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAA0YD88AAAABXnag6g","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pandas-dev/pandas/labels/freq%20retention","name":"freq retention","color":"c5def5","default":false,"description":"User expects \"freq\" attribute to be preserved"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"bgollop","id":64937237,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0OTM3MjM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64937237?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bgollop","html_url":"https://github.com/bgollop","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bgollop/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bgollop/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bgollop/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bgollop/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bgollop/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bgollop/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bgollop/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bgollop/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bgollop/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"sanjanam1998","id":36978563,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2OTc4NTYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36978563?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanjanam1998","html_url":"https://github.com/sanjanam1998","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanjanam1998/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanjanam1998/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanjanam1998/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanjanam1998/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanjanam1998/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanjanam1998/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanjanam1998/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanjanam1998/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanjanam1998/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":9,"created_at":"2020-04-27T21:20:32Z","updated_at":"2025-10-30T16:57:03Z","closed_at":"2025-10-30T16:57:03Z","author_association":"MEMBER","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"```\r\ndti = pd.date_range('2016-01-01', periods=5)\r\n\r\ndti.value_counts().index.freq    # <-- None\r\ndti.factorize()[1].freq   # <-- None\r\n\r\nmi = pd.MultiIndex.from_arrays([dti, dti])\r\n\r\nmi.levels[0].freq   # <-- None\r\n```\r\n\r\nThere is a comment in tests.indexes.datetimes.test_datetime `test_factorize` suggesting that freq should be preserved by factorize, but that is not checked and would fail if it were\r\n\r\n```\r\n        # freq must be preserved\r\n        idx3 = date_range(\"2000-01\", periods=4, freq=\"M\", tz=\"Asia/Tokyo\")\r\n        exp_arr = np.array([0, 1, 2, 3], dtype=np.intp)\r\n        arr, idx = idx3.factorize()\r\n        tm.assert_numpy_array_equal(arr, exp_arr)\r\n        tm.assert_index_equal(idx, idx3)\r\n```\r\n\r\nSo the question: do we want to try to preserve freq in factorize?\r\n\r\nxref #33677 for the MultiIndex case\r\n\r\n<b>Update</b> One more: Categorical:\r\n\r\n```\r\ndti = pd.date_range('2016-01-01', periods=5)\r\ncat = pd.Categorical(dti)\r\ncat.categories.freq   # <-- None\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"mroeschke","id":10647082,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjQ3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10647082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mroeschke","html_url":"https://github.com/mroeschke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mroeschke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mroeschke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mroeschke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mroeschke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mroeschke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mroeschke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mroeschke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mroeschke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mroeschke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pandas-dev/pandas/issues/33830/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pandas-dev/pandas/issues/33830/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}